    f"Controlled Treatment Effect:\n+$\\hat{{\\beta}}_{{SOI}} = +{b_law:.2f}$ pp ($p < 0.001$)\n(Naive OVB: +{model_naive.params['has_soi_law']:.2f} pp)",
